@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title 11. Supervisor Agent State Machine

skinparam shadowing false

[*] --> REQUEST_VALIDATED
REQUEST_VALIDATED --> HISTORY_LOADED
HISTORY_LOADED --> PLANNED
PLANNED --> HITL_EVALUATING
HITL_EVALUATING --> HITL_WAITING : review required
HITL_EVALUATING --> ROUTING_SELECTED : review not required
HITL_WAITING --> HITL_APPROVED : decision=APPROVE
HITL_WAITING --> HITL_CANCELED : decision=CANCEL
HITL_APPROVED --> ROUTING_SELECTED
HITL_CANCELED --> COMPLETED

ROUTING_SELECTED --> A2A_CALLING : plans exist
ROUTING_SELECTED --> COMPOSING : no plan

A2A_CALLING --> A2A_RESULT_MERGED : call success
A2A_CALLING --> HUMAN_MESSAGE : call failed and unrecoverable
A2A_RESULT_MERGED --> ROUTING_SELECTED : next plan exists
A2A_RESULT_MERGED --> COMPOSING : all plans done

COMPOSING --> COMPLETED
HUMAN_MESSAGE --> COMPLETED
COMPLETED --> [*]

note right of A2A_CALLING
Per-call policy
- endpoint allowlist check
- timeout/retry
- circuit breaker
end note

note left of HITL_WAITING
Swarm state snapshot is updated
- review request metadata
- stateVersion
- decision event log
end note

' 2026-04-12 sync with docs 30/31
' - Scope: HITL decision limited to APPROVE/CANCEL in current phase
' - Data mutation requests (create/update/delete) require mandatory HITL
' - A2A compatibility mode keeps both legacy and v1.0 methods
' - User profile input collection is deferred to next phase
@enduml
